# ============================================================
# Package manager lock files (keep one, ignore the rest)
# If your team uses npm, keep package-lock.json and ignore pnpm-lock.yaml.
# If your team uses pnpm, keep pnpm-lock.yaml and ignore package-lock.json.
# Uncomment the one you don't use:
